.claude/

# User data — must never be committed (see README → Data & privacy).
# Repeated here (not only in server/.gitignore) so it holds even if files move or that file changes.
server/data/
server/uploads/*
!server/uploads/.gitkeep
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.db-journal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
